{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_58_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，新延廐。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"延廐者，法廐也。其言新，有故也。有故，則何為書也？古之君人者，必時視民之所勤。民勤於力，則功築罕；民勤於財，則貢賦少；民勤於食，則百事廢矣。冬，築微。春，新延廐，以其用民力為已悉矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"二、夏，鄭人侵許。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"三、秋，有蜚。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"一有一亡曰有。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，紀叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"五、城諸及防。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_58_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_58","textTraditional":"可城也，以大及小也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}